{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-07-12 09:29:00', 'title': "CENTENE'S DELAWARE SUBSIDIARY AWARDED STATEWIDE MEDICAID CONTRACT", 'text': "AWARD MARKS CENTENE'S 30TH MEDICAID MANAGED CARE STATE ST. LOUIS , JULY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS SUBSIDIARY DELAWARE FIRST HEALTH HAS BEEN NOTIFIED OF AN INTENT TO AWARD BY THE STATE OF DELAWARE'S DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH AND SOCIAL SERVICES (DHSS), DIVISION OF MEDICAID & MEDICAL ASSISTANCE (DMMA), TO SERVE ITS STATEWIDE MEDICAID MANAGED CARE PROGRAMS."}